{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIwL0NsYXNzJTIwQWN0aW9uJTIwUGFyayUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Class Action Park","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/AoNojvxMhZtdVu9V8LtjfXJ6TPT.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iwIgSq0uOJA9oJd38XbjG5hiMg4.jpg","description":"Class Action Park explores the legend, legacy, and truth behind the 1980s water park in Vernon, New Jersey that long ago entered the realm of myth. Known for its dangerous, unsupervised rides and lack of regulation, guests of Action Park expected to walk away with injuries and were lucky if they made it out alive. Shirking the trappings of nostalgia, the film uses investigative journalism, original animations,  recordings, and interviews with the people who lived it to reveal the true story of Action Park.","releaseInfo":"2020","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.6","runtime":"90 min","cast":["Chris Gethard","Jason Scott","Jimmy Kimmel","Johnny Knoxville","Alison Becker","John Hodgman","Layne Staley","Jerry Cantrell"],"director":["Seth Porges","Chris Charles Scott III"],"released":"2020-08-22T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Chris Gethard","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gyzUSXWzdo2nKjAdK41il419My8.jpg"},{"name":"Jason Scott","character":"Self"},{"name":"Jimmy Kimmel","character":"Self (archive footage)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nBe0ByVL5hpPUby6rlU6DELgJ8Z.jpg"},{"name":"Johnny Knoxville","character":"Self (archive footage)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7XDKsHsLC4uNYaGsuWG1tQXWRnu.jpg"},{"name":"Alison Becker","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A8DPg4s05eXNZSUyld4aQM0NUBQ.jpg"},{"name":"John Hodgman","character":"Narrator","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xlgpI6x1OECW6V7uB70DG7BirUa.jpg"},{"name":"Layne Staley","character":"Self (archive footage)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6IcdsZnY6yIooIfQcEeYv